<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-038" chapter-id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family" source-id="s-nanshi-038-liujingli-family-ws1569807">
  <p id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p001:m0000" ref="f3x_mii_8ax">元景</persName>六弟：僧景、僧珍、叔宗、叔政、<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p001:m0017" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAD">叔珍</persName>、叔仁。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p002:m0000" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AADA">慶遠</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p002:m0003" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AADA">文和</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p002:m0006" ref="f3x_mii_8ax">元景</persName>弟子也。父<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p002:m0013" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAD">叔珍</persName>，義陽內史。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p003:m0000" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AADA">慶遠</persName>子 <persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p003:m0004" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AADAA">津</persName></p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p004:m0001" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AADAAA">仲禮</persName>，勇力兼人，少有膽氣，身長八尺，眉目疏朗。初，簡文帝爲雍州刺史，<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p004:m0035" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AADAA">津</persName>爲長史。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p005" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p005:m0000" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AADAAA">仲禮</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingli-family:p005:m0003" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AADAAB">敬禮</persName>，少以勇烈聞。</p>
</text>
